```js
  export function padStart(input, n = 2) {
    const isNeg = input < 0;
    let padded;
    if (isNeg) {
      padded = "-" + ("" + -input).padStart(n, "0");
    } else {
      padded = ("" + input).padStart(n, "0");
    }
    return padded;
  }
```
(keep the `export function padStart(input, n = 2) {` signature and 2-space indentation; do not change any other function).

=== BUG B: objToLocalTS is wrong for years 0-99 when the month overflows the year ===
Reported: "There is a bug in src/impl/util.js. Once it is fixed, the test `DateTime#plus works across the 100 barrier when passing through February` should pass."
Current code (around line 155):
```js
